flowchart TB
accTitle: Sanitization must precede publication
accDescr: A restricted Glue job transforms raw data, and a validation gate controls whether a complete sanitized batch becomes visible downstream.
RAW[Restricted raw S3 batch]:::storage --> JOB[Glue Spark transformation]
CAT[Catalog metadata]:::inputData -. schema .-> JOB
REF[Object references only]:::inputData --> JOB
JOB --> STAGE[Restricted sanitized staging]:::storage
STAGE --> VALID{Complete and valid?}:::decision
VALID -->|yes| PUB[Publish batch manifest]:::output
PUB --> OUT[Downstream S3 batch]:::storage
VALID -->|no| HOLD[Hold batch for repair]:::warning
